\'s Gemini models. Fast and inexpensive.'=>'Google 的 Gemini 模型。快速且经济实惠。','A European AI company with fast, inexpensive models.'=>'一家拥有快速且经济实惠模型的欧洲人工智能公司。','Low-cost models that are good at writing and code.'=>'擅长写作与代码的高性价比模型。','One key for models from many different providers.'=>'一个密钥，适用于来自许多不同提供商的模型。','Any service that works like OpenAI\'s API, including a model running on your own computer or server.'=>'任何像 OpenAI 的 API 一样运行的服务，包括在您自己的计算机或服务器上运行的模型。','General (used when nothing more specific is set)'=>'通用（在未设置更具体选项时使用）','Writing and rewriting'=>'写入与重写','Translation'=>'翻译','Code and CSS'=>'代码和 CSS','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'抱歉，您无权访问此页面。','These settings are shared by every plugin that uses them: %s.'=>'以下插件共用这些设置：%s。','Your keys are encrypted in this site\'s database and are only ever sent to the provider you chose — never to us.'=>'您的密钥已在此网站的数据库中加密，且只会发送至您所选的提供商——绝不会发送给我们。','Step 1 of 2: choose an AI provider'=>'第 1 步（共 2 步）：选择 AI 提供商','You bring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'您使用自己的密钥，因此您直接向服务商支付实际使用的费用。不确定吗？以下这些都可以很好地运行；您以后还可以添加更多。','Next'=>'下一步','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'第 2 步，共 2 步：连接 %s','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'请输入您的 OpenAI 兼容服务地址，以 /v1 结尾。仅当服务要求时才需要密钥。','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'打开 %s 并登录（或创建一个免费账户）。','the %s API keys page'=>'%s API 密钥页面','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'创建新密钥并将其复制。','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'将其粘贴在下方，然后点击“保存并测试”。我们会发送一个小请求来检查其是否正常工作。','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'大多数提供商需要在账户中有少许余额后，密钥才能生效：%s。','add credit'=>'添加额度','← Choose a different provider'=>'← 选择其他提供商','Address'=>'地址','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'已保存的密钥以……%s结尾——请粘贴新密钥以替换它','Key (optional)'=>'密钥（可选）','