,'Save, and check now if turned on'=>'保存，如已开启则立即检查','a newer list was installed'=>'已安装更新的列表','already up to date'=>'已经是最新版本','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'下载未通过签名检查，已被忽略','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'无法连接到 Zinn Digital®；当前列表将继续使用','turned off'=>'已关闭','Open'=>'打开','Check their status page'=>'查看其状态页面','Open your billing page'=>'打开您的账单页面','Open your API keys page'=>'打开您的 API 密钥页面','Open the AI settings'=>'打开AI设置','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'很抱歉，您无权执行此操作。','Unknown provider.'=>'未知服务商。','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'输入您的服务地址，例如 http://localhost:11434/v1。','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'这看起来不像 API 密钥。请重新复制，不要包含空格。','Paste your API key first.'=>'请先粘贴您的API密钥。','Key removed.'=>'密钥已移除。','Models saved.'=>'已保存模型。','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'请输入模型的准确名称，例如照供应商文档中的写法输入。','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'已添加 %s。请在“使用哪个模型”下进行选择。','Model removed.'=>'已移除模型。','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'每日更新已关闭。将使用插件自带的列表。','Checked: %s.'=>'已勾选：%s。','Model lists refreshed.'=>'模型列表已刷新。','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'您的 AI 密钥已被某个插件的较新版本保存。请更新此插件，或在 AI 设置中重新输入密钥。','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'您保存的 AI 密钥已无法打开（网站的安全密钥已更改）。请在 AI 设置中重新输入。','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'AI 尚未设置。请在 AI 设置中添加 AI 提供商的密钥。','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'此任务未选择模型。请在 AI 设置中选择一个。','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'此版本的插件不支持该 AI 提供商。','No AI provider that can make images is connected. Add an OpenAI or Google Gemini key in the AI settings.'=>'未连接能够生成图像的 AI 提供商。请在 AI 设置中添加 OpenAI 或 Google Gemini 密钥。','This AI provider cannot make images. Choose OpenAI or Google Gemini for images in the AI settings.'=>'此 AI 提供商无法生成图像。请在 AI 设置中选择 OpenAI 或 Google Gemini 以生成图像。','Your AI key cannot use any image model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for images.'=>'您的 AI 密钥无法使用任何图像模型。请向提供商检查该密钥的权限，或为图像选择其他提供商。','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'本网站无法连接到您的AI服务。请检查该服务是否正在运行，且其地址可从您的网络服务器访问（托管网站无法访问您本地计算机上的服务）。','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'无法访问 %s。请检查其状态页面；如果该网站运行正常，则可能是您的主机正在阻止出站连接，或者地址输入错误。','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s 表示您的账户已无可用额度或配额。请在其账户中添加额度或提高限制，然后重试。','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s 未接受您的密钥。它可能输入错误、已被撤销或已过期。请创建一个新密钥并将其粘贴在此处。','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s 拒绝了此密钥的请求。该密钥可能无权访问此模型或功能，或者您的账户需要验证。','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'您的密钥无法从 %2$s 获取模型 "%1$s"。请在 AI 设置中选择其他模型。','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'您的 %2$s 方案不包含模型 "%1$s"。请在 AI 设置中选择其他模型，或通过他们升级您的方案。','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s 限制了您的密钥发送请求的速度。请稍候片刻再试，或者提高您与该方的速率限制。','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s 目前遇到问题（对方服务器出现宕机或过载）。您的设置没有问题。请稍后重试。','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'AI 请求因未知原因失败。请重试；如果问题仍然存在，请将以下详细信息提供给客服支持。','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'AI提供商返回了此插件无法读取的格式。请重试；如果问题持续存在，请选择其他模型或联系支持人员。','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'自定义 (兼容 OpenAI)','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'请先为该服务商保存密钥。','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'您的密钥有效，但提供商未列出该密钥对应的文本模型。请在下方自行添加模型。','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'已连接：%1$s 使用 %2$s 接听。您的人工智能功能已准备就绪。','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'您的用户角色不允许在本网站上使用人工智能。请联系管理员。','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'此网站已达到每月的 AI 消费限额。管理员可以在 AI 设置中提高限额。','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'此网站已达到每月的 AI 请求额度上限。管理员可以在 AI 设置中提高该额度。','Usage and cost'=>'使用情况和费用','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'日志、限制和角色权限适用于通过以下方式使用的 AI：%s。','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'费用为约数，根据公布的价格计算；没有已知价格的型号计为零。','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'本月：%1$s 个请求，约 %2$s。','When'=>'当','Who'=>'谁','Used for'=>'用于','Model'=>'型号','Tokens in / out'=>'输入 / 输出','About'=>'关于','Result'=>'结果','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'尚未发出任何 AI 请求。','Done'=>'已完成','Limits and permissions'=>'限制与权限','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'每月消费限额（US 美元）','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'留空则表示不设限制。当大致费用达到该限额时，AI将在该月的剩余时间内停止服务。','Monthly request limit'=>'每月请求限制','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'留空则不设限制。','Who may use AI'=>'谁可以使用 AI','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'不勾选则允许所有能够使用该插件功能的人使用 AI。管理员始终可以使用。','Save limits and permissions'=>'保存限制和权限','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'限制和权限已保存。','Security error, please refresh the page and try again.'=>'安全错误，请刷新页面后重试。','Missing newsletter settings. Please contact the admin.'=>'缺少简报设置。请联系管理员。','Invalid newsletter settings. Please contact the admin.'=>'无效的时事通讯设置。请联系管理员。','Invalid email address.'=>'无效的电子邮件地址。','Too many attempts. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'尝试次数过多。请在几分钟后重试。','Something went wrong. Please contact the admin.'=>'出错了，请联系管理员。','Map'=>'映射','Background video'=>'背景视频','%1$s: %2$d font files stored, stylesheet %3$s'=>'%1$s：已存储 %2$d 个字体文件，样式表 %3$s','That family is not stored.'=>'该系列未存储。','Removed.'=>'已移除','That is not a valid font family name.'=>'这不是一个有效的字体系列名称。','Google Fonts did not return that family. Check the name and try again.'=>'Google Fonts 未返回该字体族。请检查名称后重试。','The font files could not be downloaded or saved. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'无法下载或保存字体文件。请检查上传文件夹是否具有写入权限。','The font stylesheet could not be saved. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'无法保存字体样式表。请检查上传文件夹是否具有写入权限。','Dismiss this notice'=>'忽略此通知','Design'=>'设计','Content'=>'内容','Media'=>'媒体','Marketing'=>'市场营销','Site'=>'站点','Data'=>'数据','The admin screen\'s scripts are missing from this copy of the plugin. Reinstall it from a released package.'=>'此插件副本缺少管理屏幕的脚本。请从发布的程序包中重新安装。','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'此屏幕需要 JavaScript。','Languages'=>'语言','The prefix must be 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, start with a letter, and must not name the plugin.'=>'前缀必须为 1 到 8 个小写字母或数字，以字母开头，且不能与插件名称相同。','You are not allowed to edit this item.'=>'您无权编辑此项目。','You are not allowed to do this.'=>'您无权执行此操作。','Safe mode was turned off because it no longer matches your login. Reload the page.'=>'安全模式已关闭，因为它与您的登录信息不再匹配。请重新加载页面。','Only an administrator can use safe mode.'=>'只有管理员才能使用安全模式。','Safe mode needs a normal browser login.'=>'安全模式需要使用常规浏览器登录。','Safe mode could not be set up.'=>'安全模式无法设置。','Safe mode needs write access to the wp-content/mu-plugins folder.'=>'安全模式需要对 wp-content/mu-plugins 文件夹的写入权限。','Safe mode could not write to the wp-content/mu-plugins folder.'=>'安全模式无法写入 wp-content/mu-plugins 文件夹。','Sandwich Studio'=>'三明治工作室','That page does not exist, or it has been deleted.'=>'该页面不存在，或者已被删除。','Sorry, you are not allowed to edit this item in Sandwich Studio.'=>'抱歉，您无权在 Sandwich Studio 中编辑此项目。','Sandwich Studio is not built. Reinstall the plugin.'=>'Sandwich Studio 未构建。请重新安装该插件。','Add title'=>'添加标题','Type / to choose a block'=>'输入 / 选择区块','Loading Sandwich Studio…'=>'正在加载 Sandwich Studio……','Sandwich Studio needs JavaScript. Use the normal editor instead.'=>'Sandwich Studio 需要 JavaScript。请改用普通编辑器。','Edit “%s” with Sandwich Studio'=>'使用 Sandwich Studio 编辑“%s”','Edit with Sandwich Studio'=>'使用 Sandwich Studio 编辑','Blank canvas'=>'空白画布','The tablet width must be a whole number of pixels from 480 to 2560.'=>'平板电脑宽度必须是 480 到 2560 之间的一个整数像素。','The mobile width must be a whole number of pixels, at least 240 and smaller than the tablet width.'=>'移动端宽度必须是一个整数像素，不小于240且小于平板端宽度。','Each custom breakpoint needs its own id: 2 to 12 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'每个自定义断点都需要自己的 ID：2 到 12 个小写字母或数字，且必须以字母开头。','A custom breakpoint applies either up to a width (200 to 4000 pixels) or from a width (200 to 6000 pixels), not both.'=>'自定义断点要么适用于特定宽度以下（200 到 4000 像素），要么适用于特定宽度以上（200 到 6000 像素），不能两者兼具。','Tablet'=>'平板电脑','Mobile'=>'移动设备','Site design'=>'网站设计','Colours, fonts and styles shared by every page of the site and by your theme.'=>'网站每个页面和您的主题所共用的颜色、字体和样式。','The site\'s global styles could not be opened.'=>'无法打开该站点的全局样式。','That font is not one of the site\'s fonts.'=>'该字体不是网站的字体之一。','Each colour needs a unique name made of lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'每种颜色都需要一个由小写字母、数字和连字符组成的唯一名称。','The colour "%s" is not a valid CSS colour.'=>'颜色“%s”不是有效的 CSS 颜色。','Each font needs a unique name made of lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'每个字体都需要一个由小写字母、数字和连字符组成的唯一名称。','The font stack for "%s" may contain only font names, quotes, commas and spaces.'=>'“%s”的字体内置列表只能包含字体名称、引号、逗号和空格。','Uploaded icons'=>'已上传图标','Icon'=>'图标','This file is not an SVG icon we can use. It may be damaged, or it only held content that is removed for safety (scripts, links, embedded images or fonts).'=>'此文件不是我们可以使用的 SVG 图标。它可能已损坏，或者仅包含为安全起见而已被移除的内容（脚本、链接、嵌入图像或字体）。','The icon could not be deleted.'=>'无法删除该图标。','Part of the message telling the user what they should receive via email.a license key'=>'许可证密钥','A user has not yet been associated with the license, which is necessary to prevent unauthorized activation. To assign the license to your user, you agree to share your WordPress user\'s full name and email address.'=>'尚未将用户与许可证关联，这是防止未授权激活所必需的。要将许可证分配给您的用户，即表示您同意共享您的 WordPress 用户全名和电子邮件地址。','the above-mentioned sites'=>'上述网站','Account'=>'账户','Account Details'=>'账户详情','Account is pending activation. Please check your email and click the link to activate your account and then submit the affiliate form again.'=>'账户正在等待激活。请检查您的电子邮件并点击链接激活账户，然后再次提交联盟营销人员表单。','Would you like to merge %1$s into %2$s?'=>'您是否要将 %1$s 合并到 %2$s 中？','Actions'=>'操作','Activate'=>'激活','Activate Free Version'=>'激活免费版','Activate License'=>'激活许可证','activate a license here'=>'在此处激活许可证','Please enter the license key that you received in the email right after the purchase:'=>'请输入您在购买后立即在电子邮件中收到的许可证密钥：','Activate license on all sites in the network.'=>'激活网络中所有站点的许可证。','Activate license on all pending sites.'=>'在所有待处理的网站上激活许可证。',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please activate it to start benefiting from the %2$s features. %3$s'=>'%1$s 的付费版本已安装。请激活它以开始使用 %2$s 功能。%3$s',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please navigate to the %2$s to activate it and start benefiting from the %3$s features.'=>'%1$s 的付费版本已安装。请前往 %2$s 进行激活，并开始享受 %3$s 功能带来的便利。','Activate 