 licence'=>'此许可证下的站点','Version'=>'版本','This looks like a staging or local copy, so it does not use up a site on your licence.'=>'这看起来像是一个暂存副本或本地副本，因此它不会占用您许可证上的一个站点。','See what Pro adds'=>'查看 Pro 版新增功能','Go to'=>'转至','Personal'=>'个人','Business'=>'商业','Agency'=>'代理机构','Any number of sites'=>'任意数量的网站','Unlimited sites'=>'无限站点','%d site'=>'%d 个站点','Pro'=>'专业版','%s trial'=>'%s 试用','Your trial has started. Reload the page to see every Pro feature.'=>'您的试用已开始。重新加载页面以查看所有 Pro 功能。','The trial could not be started.'=>'无法开始试用。','Feature'=>'功能','Included'=>'已包含','Not included'=>'未包含','Your licence'=>'您的许可证','%1$d of %2$d in use'=>'已使用 %1$d / %2$d','Renews'=>'续订','Staging, test and localhost copies of a site are free and never count toward your site limit.'=>'网站的暂存、测试和本地副本都是免费的，且绝不会计入您的网站数量限制。','Your plan includes priority support.'=>'您的套餐包含优先支持。','Manage your licence and billing'=>'管理您的许可证和账单','Get more with Pro'=>'升级至 Pro 版获取更多功能','Start a free %d-day trial, no card needed'=>'开始免费试用 %d 天，无需绑定银行卡','See plans and prices'=>'查看套餐与价格','Use Tranzly and Page Builder Sandwich together? The bundle includes both Pro plugins for less.'=>'一起使用 Tranzly 和 Page Builder Sandwich？该捆绑包包含两款 Pro 插件，价格更优惠。','Your licence has expired. Renew it to keep getting updates and Pro features.'=>'您的许可证已过期。续订以继续获取更新和专业版功能。','Renew now'=>'立即续费','Compare the plans'=>'对比方案','Search features'=>'搜索功能','Area'=>'区域','Included in'=>'包含在内','No feature matches.'=>'没有匹配的功能。','Features by plan'=>'按套餐划分的功能','Hide'=>'隐藏','Activate it on the Plugins screen'=>'在“插件”屏幕上激活它','Install it'=>'安装','Overview'=>'概览','Setup'=>'设置','Plans and licence'=>'方案与许可证','Add-ons'=>'附加组件','Get help'=>'获取帮助','Feedback'=>'反馈','Your choice could not be saved.'=>'无法保存您的选择。','The setup state could not be saved.'=>'无法保存设置状态。','Match my computer'=>'匹配我的计算机','Light'=>'浅色','Dark'=>'深色','Colour scheme'=>'配色方案','Help'=>'帮助','Guide to this screen'=>'此屏幕指南','Take the tour'=>'查看导览','Get help or report a bug'=>'获取帮助或报告错误','Plugin screens'=>'插件屏幕','That could not be saved.'=>'无法保存。','Before you contact support'=>'联系客服前','Your request is sent from this site to %s, who make this plugin. We send:'=>'您的请求将从本网站发送至该插件的开发者 %s。我们将发送：','your e-mail address and name, so we can reply;'=>'您的电子邮件地址和姓名，以便我们回复；','the subject and message you write;'=>'您所撰写的主题和正文；','your licence ID, so paying customers get priority;'=>'您的许可证 ID，以便付费客户获得优先服务；','only if you tick it: site details (WordPress and PHP versions, theme, plugins, an excerpt of the error log with passwords and e-mail addresses removed), which you can read before sending;'=>'仅在你勾选的情况下：网站详细信息（WordPress 和 PHP 版本、主题、插件、已移除密码和电子邮件地址的错误日志摘录），你可以在发送前进行查看；','only if you add them: logins for your site, stored encrypted and deleted 30 days after your request is closed.'=>'仅当您添加它们时：您网站的登录信息，经过加密存储，并在您的请求关闭 30 天后删除。','Privacy policy'=>'隐私政策','I agree, continue'=>'我同意，继续','The connection could not be checked.'=>'无法检查该连接。','That did not work. Try again.'=>'操作未成功。请重试。','Zinn Digital® support disconnected this site.'=>'Zinn Digital® 支持团队已断开此网站的连接。','Zinn Digital® support no longer recognises this site.'=>'Zinn Digital® 支持团队不再识别此网站。','You disconnected this site.'=>'您已断开此网站的连接。','Connect this site to support'=>'将此站点连接到支持服务','Connected. Replies go to %s.'=>'已连接。回复将发送至 %s。','Not connected. You can still send a request with your e-mail address below; connecting saves typing it each time.'=>'未连接。您仍可通过下方的电子邮件地址发送请求；连接后可免去每次输入的麻烦。','E-mail address'=>'电子邮件地址','Your name (optional)'=>'您的姓名（可选）','I agree to connect this site to Zinn Digital® support. It sends this site’s address, WordPress and PHP versions and the plugin version, and can be disconnected at any time from here or by Zinn Digital®.'=>'我同意将此站点连接到 Zinn Digital® 支持。这会发送此站点的地址、WordPress 和 PHP 版本以及插件版本，并且可以随时在此处或通过 Zinn Digital® 断开连接。','Connect'=>'连接','I need help'=>'需要帮助','Report a bug'=>'报告错误','Send feedback'=>'发送反馈','Request a feature'=>'提交功能建议','The site details could not be read.'=>'无法读取网站详细信息。','Your request could not be sent. Try again in 