ur computer. Your choice is remembered for you only.'=>'选择浅色、深色或与您的电脑相同。您的选择仅为您记住。','Welcome'=>'欢迎','This short tour shows where things are. You can leave it at any time with Escape.'=>'本简短导览将向您展示各功能的位置。您可以随时按 Esc 键退出。','Your site at a glance'=>'您的网站概览','Setup progress and your plan are shown here, with the next thing worth doing.'=>'此处显示设置进度、您的套餐以及接下来最值得去做的操作。','Your plan, how many sites it covers, and whether this copy of the site counts toward that limit.'=>'您的套餐、它涵盖的网站数量，以及此网站副本是否计入该限制。','Try Pro or upgrade'=>'试用专业版或升级','Start a free trial without a card, upgrade, or renew, all from here.'=>'无需绑定银行卡即可开始免费试用，或在此处直接进行升级或续费。','Every feature and the plan that includes it. Search for a feature or show one area at a time.'=>'每个功能及包含该功能的套餐。搜索功能或一次显示一个区域。','More from Zinn Digital®'=>'更多来自 Zinn Digital® 的内容','Plugins that work with this one, and services from the same team. Cards you hid on other screens can be shown again here.'=>'与此插件兼容的插件以及来自同一团队的服务。您在此处可以重新显示在其他屏幕上隐藏的卡片。','Connect for faster help'=>'连接以获得更快帮助','Connecting is optional. It lets you send requests without typing your e-mail each time, and you can disconnect whenever you like.'=>'连接是可选的。它允许您发送请求时不必每次都输入电子邮件，并且您可以随时断开连接。','Ask for help or report a bug'=>'寻求帮助或报告错误','Describe what happened. You choose whether to attach site information, and you can see exactly what it contains first.'=>'请描述所发生的情况。您可以选择是否附加网站信息，并且可以在发送前准确查看其包含的内容。','Temporary support access'=>'临时支持访问权限','If support needs to look inside your site, create a temporary login here. It deletes itself when it expires, and you can remove it at any time.'=>'如果客服人员需要查看您的网站内容，请在此处创建临时登录账号。该账号过期后会自动删除，您也可以随时将其删除。','Tell us what to build'=>'告诉我们需要构建什么','Send an idea, a feature request or any feedback. It goes straight to the team.'=>'发送想法、功能请求或任何反馈。这些内容将直接发送给团队。','This takes a few minutes and sets up %s so it works on this site straight away. You can change everything later.'=>'这需要几分钟，并会进行设置，使 %s 立即在此网站上生效。您可以稍后更改所有内容。','You are ready. If anything does not work as expected, we are one click away.'=>'您已准备就绪。如果任何功能未能如预期运行，我们随时为您提供协助。','Step %1$d of %2$d: %3$s'=>'第 %1$d 步，共 %2$d 步：%3$s','Finish'=>'完成','Skip setup'=>'跳过设置','Built by Neil Lock, CEO of Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'由 Zinn Digital® Ltd 首席执行官 Neil Lock 构建','Version %s'=>'版本 %s','Page Builder Sandwich website'=>'Page Builder Sandwich 网站','Zinn Digital® website'=>'Zinn Digital® 网站','Settings saved.'=>'设置已保存。','See the Pro plans and pricing'=>'查看 Pro 方案与价格','Front-end output'=>'前端输出','Class name prefix'=>'类名前缀','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'插件在您的页面上输出的每个类名都以此前缀开头，这样页面就不会暴露是哪个插件构建的。1 到 8 个小写字母或数字，且必须以字母开头。','Save'=>'保存','Beta updates'=>'Beta 更新','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'此站点接收测试版作为更新。','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'此网站仅接收稳定版本。','Change this on the Account page'=>'请在“账户”页面上更改此设置','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'测试版仅向与其账户关联的已授权 Pro 安装提供。连接后，您即可从“账户”页面加入。','Breakpoints saved. Pages pick up the new widths on their next view.'=>'断点已保存。页面将在下次查看时应用新的宽度。','Breakpoints'=>'断点','Styles set for Tablet apply up to the tablet width, and styles set for Mobile up to the mobile width. Desktop styles apply everywhere else.'=>'平板电脑的样式适用于平板电脑宽度以下，手机的样式适用于手机宽度以下。桌面样式适用于其他所有地方。','Tablet: up to (px)'=>'平板电脑：最大（像素）','Mobile: up to (px)'=>'移动端：最大 (px)','Save breakpoints'=>'保存断点','Use the default widths'=>'使用默认宽度','Settings'=>'设置','The request converting this post stopped before it finished, so the post was skipped. Open it to convert it, or convert it again from here.'=>'转换此文章的请求在完成前已停止，因此该文章已被跳过。打开它以进行转换，或从此处再次转换。','There is no backup of this post to restore.'=>'没有可恢复的此文章备份。','The converted content could not be saved.'=>'无法保存转换后的内容。','Unknown error.'=>'未知错误。','No legacy content has been checked yet.'=>'尚未检查任何旧版内容。','Restoring legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'正在恢复旧内容：共 %2$d 篇中的第 %1$d 篇。','Converting legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'正在转换旧内容：%1$d/%2$d 篇发布。','Undo finished: %1$d restored, %2$d failed.'=>'撤销完成：已恢复 %1$d 个，失败 %2$d 个。','Conversion finished: %1$d converted, %2$d unchanged, %3$d failed.'=>'转换完成：%1$d 个已转换，%2$d 个未更改，%3$d 个失败。','Legacy content'=>'旧版内容','Pages made with earlier versions of Page Builder Sandwich are converted to blocks in the background. Every post is backed up first, so each conversion can be undone.'=>'使用早期版本的 Page Builder Sandwich 创建的页面会在后台转换为区块。系统会先备份每篇文章，因此每项转换都可以撤销。','%d post still holds legacy content.'=>'%d 篇发布仍然包含旧版内容。','%d post has a backup.'=>'%d 篇文章已有备份。','%d post could not be handled'=>'无法处理 %d 篇文章','Post %d'=>'文章 %d','Conversion started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'转换已开始。它将在后台继续运行，您可以离开此页面。','Convert legacy content'=>'转换旧版内容','Restore every converted post to its legacy content? Changes made to those posts since they were converted will be lost.'=>'要将所有已转换的文章恢复为旧版内容吗？自转换以来对这些文章所做的更改将会丢失。','Undo started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'撤销已开始。它将继续在后台运行，您可以离开此页面。','Undo all conversions'=>'撤销所有转换','Alert'=>'警报','Information'=>'信息','Success'=>'成功','Warnings and errors are announced to screen reader users straight away; information and success notices are read when they finish what they are doing.'=>'警告和错误信息会立即向屏幕阅读器用户播报，而信息和成功通知则会在他们完成当前操作后进行朗读。','Show icon'=>'显示图标','Visitors can close it'=>'访客可以关闭它','Title (optional)'=>'标题（可选）','Write the message…'=>'编写消息…','section — a thematic section'=>'部分 — 主题部分','div — no meaning'=>'div — 无含义','header — introductory content'=>'页眉 — 引导内容','footer — closing content'=>'页脚 — 结束内容','article — self-contained content'=>'文章 — 独立内容','aside — related content'=>'相关内容','main — the main content (once per page)'=>'main — 主要内容（每页一次）','nav — navigation links'=>'nav — 导航链接','Stack (flexbox, column)'=>'堆栈 (flexbox，纵向)','Row (