=>'在 Sandwich Studio 中编辑','Saving failed. Check your connection and try again; your changes are kept in this browser.'=>'保存失败。请检查您的网络连接并重试；您的更改已保留在当前浏览器中。','Published.'=>'已发布。','Saved.'=>'已保存。','Maintenance and pre-launch mode'=>'维护与预发布模式','What visitors see'=>'访客看到的内容','The site, as normal'=>'站点恢复正常','Maintenance: a notice, and search engines are told to come back later'=>'维护：发布通知并指示搜索引擎稍后访问','Pre-launch: a notice, and search engines are told not to index the site'=>'预发布：一条通知，并告知搜索引擎不要索引该网站','Page to show instead'=>'显示为此页面','Design any page with the builder and choose it here. Without one, visitors see a short notice with the site’s name.'=>'使用构建器设计任意页面并在此处选择。如果没有此页面，访问者将看到一条包含网站名称的简短通知。','Who still sees the real site (administrators always do):'=>'谁仍能看到真实网站（管理员总是可以看到）：','Open the site in a private window to see what visitors see.'=>'在无痕窗口中打开网站，查看访客看到的页面。','Network settings saved.'=>'网络设置已保存。','These settings apply to the %d site in this network.'=>'这些设置适用于此网络中的 %d 个网站。','Shared templates'=>'共享模板','Patterns saved on the main site that are ticked here appear on every site, under “Network templates”. Each site inserts its own copy.'=>'在主站上保存并在此处勾选的图案将显示在每个站点的“网络模板”下方。每个站点都会插入其自己的副本。','The main site has no saved patterns yet.'=>'主站点尚无已保存的图案。','White label for every site'=>'每个网站均可使用白标','Used by every site that has not saved its own white-label settings.'=>'由每个未保存其自有白标设置的网站使用。','Turn white label on'=>'启用白标','Builder name'=>'生成器名称','Visual editor name'=>'可视化编辑器名称','Author'=>'作者','Author website'=>'作者网站','Menu icon'=>'菜单图标','Role defaults for every site'=>'每个网站的角色默认设置','Save network settings'=>'保存网络设置','Searching… %d item checked so far.'=>'正在搜索… 目前已检查 %d 个项目。','No matches in %d items. Nothing to replace.'=>'在 %d 个项目中没有找到匹配项。无可替换的内容。','%1$d matches on %2$d pages (%3$d items searched). Nothing has changed yet.'=>'在 %2$d 个页面上找到 %1$d 个匹配项（已搜索 %3$d 个项目）。目前没有任何更改。','Replacing… %1$d of %2$d pages done.'=>'正在替换……已完成 %1$d/%2$d 页。','Done: %d page changed. You can undo this.'=>'已完成