的通知：信息、成功、警告或错误，带有可选的标题和关闭按钮。','block keywordnotice'=>'通知','block keywordmessage'=>'消息','block keywordcallout'=>'标注框','block keywordwarning'=>'警告','block titleButton link'=>'按钮链接','block descriptionA link styled as a button.'=>'样式为按钮的链接。','block keywordbutton'=>'按钮','block keywordlink'=>'链接','block keywordcall to action'=>'行动号召','block titleColumn'=>'列','block descriptionA column inside a row. It can hold any block.'=>'行内的一列。它可以包含任意区块。','block keywordcolumn'=>'列','block keywordlayout'=>'布局','block titleContainer'=>'容器','block descriptionA box that lays out the blocks inside it with flexbox or a grid. Nest containers to build any layout. Stays readable if the plugin is ever turned off.'=>'使用 flexbox 或网格布局来排列内部块的容器。嵌套容器可构建任意布局。即使插件停用，内容依然保持可读。','block keywordcontainer'=>'容器','block keywordbox'=>'框','block keywordgrid'=>'网格','block keywordflexbox'=>'弹性盒','block keywordcolumns'=>'列','block titleLanguage switcher (sample)'=>'语言切换器（示例）','block descriptionLists the site\'s languages from the translation plugin, when one is active. It renders nothing otherwise.'=>'列出翻译插件中的网站语言（当插件处于激活状态时）。否则不呈现任何内容。','block keywordlanguage'=>'语言','block keywordswitcher'=>'切换器','block titleSample content'=>'示例内容','block descriptionA heading and a paragraph, rendered with neutral class names. It is the reference block for the translation contract.'=>'一个标题和一个段落，使用中性类名进行渲染。它是翻译合同的参考块。','block keywordsample'=>'示例','block keywordtext'=>'文本','block titleIcon'=>'图标','block descriptionAn SVG icon. The markup is cleaned before it is shown.'=>'一个SVG图标。在显示之前，其标记已被清理。','block keywordicon'=>'图标','block keywordsvg'=>'SVG','block titleLanguage switcher'=>'语言切换器','block descriptionLets visitors read this page in another language, styled to match your page. Needs the Tranzly plugin for the languages.'=>'让访客以其他语言阅读此页面，其样式与您的页面相匹配。语言支持需要 Tranzly 插件。','block keywordtranslation'=>'翻译','block keywordmultilingual'=>'多语言','block titleDark mode switch'=>'深色模式切换开关','block descriptionA button that switches the website between its light and dark colours, and remembers the visitor\'s choice.'=>'一个在网站浅色和深色外观之间切换并记住访客选择的按钮。','block keyworddark'=>'深色','block keywordlight'=>'浅色','block keywordcolour scheme'=>'配色方案','block titleRow'=>'行','block descriptionA row of columns. Stays readable if the plugin is ever turned off.'=>'一列栏。即使插件关闭，也能保持可读性。','block keywordrow'=>'行','block titleSection'=>'区段','block descriptionA full-width band of the page that lays its content out with flexbox or a grid. Stays readable if the plugin is ever turned off.'=>'页面全宽色带，使用 flexbox 或网格布局其内容。即使插件被禁用，仍可保持可读性。','block keywordsection'=>'部分','block titleShortcode (add-on)'=>'简码（加载项）','block descriptionA shortcode from an add-on written for the classic Page Builder Sandwich editor, with the settings the add-on declared.'=>'来自为经典 Page Builder Sandwich 编辑器编写的附加组件的简码，包含该附加组件声明的设置。','block keywordshortcode'=>'短代码','block keywordadd-on'=>'附加组件','block titleWidget area'=>'小组件区域','block descriptionShows the widgets in one of the theme\'s widget areas.'=>'显示主题某个小部件区域中的小部件。','block keywordsidebar'=>'侧边栏','block keywordwidget area'=>'小组件区域','block titleWidget'=>'小组件','block descriptionShows one of the site\'s registered classic widgets.'=>'显示该网站注册的经典小工具之一。','block keywordwidget'=>'小部件']];